            ['start_time' => 417.395, 'end_time' => 419.495, 'target_text' => 'Both of these are actually parents.', 'source_text' => 'Kedua-dua pihak adalah ibu bapa mereka yang sah.', 'order' => 114],
            ['start_time' => 419.595, 'end_time' => 421.295, 'target_text' => 'So make sure you build a relation.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, pastikanlah anda membina hubungan yang baik.', 'order' => 115],
            ['start_time' => 421.395, 'end_time' => 424.395, 'target_text' => 'Anyway, let\'s go back to pre-divorce, right?', 'source_text' => 'Apa-apa pun, marilah kita kembali ke fasa sebelum berlakunya perceraian, ya?', 'order' => 116],
            ['start_time' => 424.495, 'end_time' => 426.495, 'target_text' => 'I touched on it because it\'s important.', 'source_text' => 'Saya menyentuh mengenainya kerana ia sangat penting.', 'order' => 117],
            ['start_time' => 426.595, 'end_time' => 430.895, 'target_text' => 'Pre-divorce, you\'re supposed to make every effort because it will impact the children.', 'source_text' => 'Sebelum perceraian berlaku, anda sepatutnya berusaha sedaya upaya menyelamatkannya kerana ia akan memberi kesan kepada anak-anak.', 'order' => 118],
            ['start_time' => 430.995, 'end_time' => 432.695, 'target_text' => 'It will impact families.', 'source_text' => 'Ia akan memberi kesan buruk kepada seluruh keluarga.', 'order' => 119],
            ['start_time' => 432.795, 'end_time' => 434.895, 'target_text' => 'PEOPLE WILL STOP TALKING to each other.', 'source_text' => 'ORANG RAMAI AKAN BERHENTI BERTEGUR SAPA antara satu sama lain.', 'order' => 120],
            ['start_time' => 434.995, 'end_time' => 436.395, 'target_text' => 'So much Shaitan does.', 'source_text' => 'Begitu dahsyat sekali kerosakan yang dicetuskan oleh syaitan.', 'order' => 121],
            ['start_time' => 436.495, 'end_time' => 445.195, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, if you fulfill the rights of those whom you have divorced, those whom you need to fulfill the rights of, you will', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: sekiranya anda menunaikan hak mereka yang telah anda ceraikan, serta mereka yang wajib anda sempurnakan haknya, anda pasti', 'order' => 122],
