            ['start_time' => 502.097, 'end_time' => 502.997, 'target_text' => 'Allah will grant them.', 'source_text' => 'Allah akan mengurniakan taufik kepada mereka.', 'order' => 141],
            ['start_time' => 503.097, 'end_time' => 508.997, 'target_text' => 'But if one wants to solve it and the other one wants to play a blame game, you\'re not going to solve the problem.', 'source_text' => 'Namun sekiranya sebelah pihak mahu berdamai manakala pihak yang satu lagi asyik menuding jari menyalahkan orang lain, kemelut itu tidak akan selesai.', 'order' => 142],
            ['start_time' => 509.097, 'end_time' => 511.897, 'target_text' => 'Who was right and wrong becomes irrelevant at a point.', 'source_text' => 'Siapa yang betul dan siapa yang salah menjadi tidak relevan lagi pada satu ketika.', 'order' => 143],
            ['start_time' => 511.997, 'end_time' => 513.397, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s discuss the matter.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah kita berbincang secara matang mengenai perkara tersebut.', 'order' => 144],
            ['start_time' => 513.497, 'end_time' => 515.797, 'target_text' => 'We can say look, this should not be repeated.', 'source_text' => 'Kita boleh berkata: \'Dengar sini, perkara ini tidak sepatutnya berulang lagi.\'', 'order' => 145],
            ['start_time' => 515.897, 'end_time' => 518.197, 'target_text' => 'It\'s important to bring up the issue at hand.', 'source_text' => 'Adalah penting untuk membangkitkan dan memperjelaskan punca isu yang sedang dihadapi.', 'order' => 146],
            ['start_time' => 518.297, 'end_time' => 524.797, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the point of going back to a spouse whom you have not even addressed the matter that resulted in the issue in the first', 'source_text' => 'Apakah gunanya kembali bersama pasangan sekiranya anda langsung tidak membincangkan punca utama yang mencetuskan pertelingkahan tersebut sejak dari awal', 'order' => 147],
            ['start_time' => 524.897, 'end_time' => 525.397, 'target_text' => 'place?', 'source_text' => 'lagi?', 'order' => 148],
            ['start_time' => 525.497, 'end_time' => 527.797, 'target_text' => 'Learn to address issues respectfully.', 'source_text' => 'Belajarlah menangani dan membincangkan masalah dengan penuh rasa hormat.', 'order' => 149],
            ['start_time' => 527.897, 'end_time' => 534.297, 'target_text' => 'You have a problem with a family member, you must raise it in a respectful, honorable way and learn to digest what someone', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda mempunyai perselisihan dengan ahli keluarga, anda wajib menyuarakannya dengan cara yang terhormat dan beradab, serta belajar menghadam teguran yang', 'order' => 150],
            ['start_time' => 534.397, 'end_time' => 535.197, 'target_text' => 'is telling you.', 'source_text' => 'dinyatakan oleh seseorang kepada anda.', 'order' => 151],
            ['start_time' => 535.297, 'end_time' => 540.297, 'target_text' => 'You could have made a mistake, you could have spoken to someone rough, you could have sworn someone, you could have said something', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin pernah melakukan kesilapan, anda mungkin pernah bercakap kasar, anda mungkin pernah mencaci seseorang, atau menuturkan sesuatu', 'order' => 152],
            ['start_time' => 540.397, 'end_time' => 541.697, 'target_text' => 'that hurt their feelings.', 'source_text' => 'yang melukakan perasaan mereka.', 'order' => 153],
            ['start_time' => 541.797, 'end_time' => 544.597, 'target_text' => 'They might have a misunderstanding regarding something that happened.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mungkin mempunyai salah faham terhadap sesuatu perkara yang telah berlaku.', 'order' => 154],
            ['start_time' => 544.697, 'end_time' => 548.797, 'target_text' => 'You must understand they if they raise it with you, don\'t start screaming and yelling.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu faham, sekiranya mereka menyuarakan perkara itu kepada anda, janganlah melenting, menjerit dan memekik.', 'order' => 155],
            ['start_time' => 548.897, 'end_time' => 550.597, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the sign of a weak person.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah tanda kelemahan seseorang.', 'order' => 156],
            ['start_time' => 550.697, 'end_time' => 552.597, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the weakness in a human being.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah kekurangan yang ada pada diri manusia.', 'order' => 157],
            ['start_time' => 552.697, 'end_time' => 559.097, 'target_text' => 'If you\'re an intelligent person and you understand Allah\'s system, you won\'t get upset even if what they are saying is totally', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda seorang yang bijaksana dan memahami aturan sunnatullah, anda tidak akan cepat melenting sekalipun apa yang mereka katakan itu songsang sama sekali,', 'order' => 158],
            ['start_time' => 559.197, 'end_time' => 560.597, 'target_text' => 'upside down, wrong.', 'source_text' => 'atau salah.', 'order' => 159],
            ['start_time' => 560.697, 'end_time' => 566.297, 'target_text' => 'Listen to it, acknowledge it, navigate it and very carefully understand it\'s delicate.', 'source_text' => 'Dengarlah dahulu, akui pandangan itu, kemudilah perbualan dengan cermat dan fahami bahawa situasi ini sangat sensitif.', 'order' => 160],
            ['start_time' => 566.397, 'end_time' => 567.797, 'target_text' => 'I need to talk properly here.', 'source_text' => 'Saya perlu bertutur dengan adab yang baik di sini.', 'order' => 161],
            ['start_time' => 567.897, 'end_time' => 568.997, 'target_text' => 'Subhan Allah.', 'source_text' => 'SubhanAllah.', 'order' => 162],
            ['start_time' => 569.097, 'end_time' => 570.597, 'target_text' => 'I need to speak in a good way.', 'source_text' => 'Saya wajib berbicara dengan cara yang terbaik.', 'order' => 163],
            ['start_time' => 570.697, 'end_time' => 576.497, 'target_text' => 'You know, the more expensive the item you\'re trying to repair is, the more delicate the repairs will be.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, semakin mahal harga barang yang cuba anda baiki, semakin halus dan teliti proses pembaikannya.', 'order' => 164],
            ['start_time' => 576.597, 'end_time' => 578.797, 'target_text' => 'I give you a quick example.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berikan satu contoh mudah kepada anda.', 'order' => 165],
            ['start_time' => 578.897, 'end_time' => 580.297, 'target_text' => 'You want to fix a Casio watch.', 'source_text' => 'Anda ingin membaiki jam tangan jenama Casio.', 'order' => 166],
            ['start_time' => 580.397, 'end_time' => 582.797, 'target_text' => 'You know the Casio, the little watch that we have, right?', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu jam Casio, jam tangan biasa yang sering kita pakai, bukan?', 'order' => 167],
            ['start_time' => 582.897, 'end_time' => 584.297, 'target_text' => 'You want to repair it, you can take it anywhere.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda ingin membaikinya, anda boleh membawanya ke mana-mana sahaja.', 'order' => 168],
            ['start_time' => 584.397, 'end_time' => 588.397, 'target_text' => 'On the side of the road, they\'ll take the whole machine out, the whole the whole the mechanism out.', 'source_text' => 'Di tepi jalan sekalipun, mereka boleh mengeluarkan seluruh enjinnya, keseluruhan mekanismenya.', 'order' => 169],
            ['start_time' => 588.497, 'end_time' => 592.797, 'target_text' => 'They\'ll take the battery out, do this, do that, put it and in another 5 seconds they\'ll put it all back, give it to you, say', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tanggalkan bateri, buat itu dan ini, pasang semula, dan dalam masa 5 saat mereka boleh pasang balik semuanya, serahkan kepada anda dan berkata:', 'order' => 170],
            ['start_time' => 592.897, 'end_time' => 593.897, 'target_text' => 'it\'s working.', 'source_text' => 'ia sudah berfungsi elok.', 'order' => 171],
            ['start_time' => 593.997, 'end_time' => 595.997, 'target_text' => 'What about a Rolex?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi bagaimana pula dengan jam tangan Rolex?', 'order' => 172],
            ['start_time' => 596.097, 'end_time' => 596.997, 'target_text' => 'You\'re not allowed to touch it.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak boleh sesuka hati menyentuhnya.', 'order' => 173],
            ['start_time' => 597.097, 'end_time' => 597.997, 'target_text' => 'They won\'t even open it.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka sendiri tidak berani membukanya sembarangan.', 'order' => 174],
            ['start_time' => 598.097, 'end_time' => 600.697, 'target_text' => 'Take it to people they say please, can you take it to the factory?', 'source_text' => 'Bawa kepada pakar, mereka akan berkata: \'Tolonglah, bolehkah anda hantar jam ini terus ke kilang rasminya?\'', 'order' => 175],
            ['start_time' => 600.797, 'end_time' => 605.997, 'target_text' => 'The factory they\'ll put gloves on before they touch it and then they\'ll make sure they put their little whatever you know,', 'source_text' => 'Di kilang tersebut, mereka akan memakai sarung tangan khas sebelum memegangnya, kemudian mereka memakai kanta pembesar khas,', 'order' => 176],
            ['start_time' => 606.097, 'end_time' => 609.297, 'target_text' => 'special lenses to be able to see and special tools.', 'source_text' => 'kanta khusus untuk melihat komponen mikro, serta peralatan yang serba canggih.', 'order' => 177],
            ['start_time' => 609.397, 'end_time' => 609.796, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah begitu?', 'order' => 178],
            ['start_time' => 609.797, 'end_time' => 610.698, 'target_text' => 'It\'s far more expensive.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana nilainya jauh lebih mahal.', 'order' => 179],
            ['start_time' => 610.798, 'end_time' => 612.298, 'target_text' => 'One blunder and you\'re gone.', 'source_text' => 'Satu kesilapan kecil sahaja, maka rosaklah jam tersebut dan anda akan menanggung kerugian besar.', 'order' => 180],
            ['start_time' => 612.398, 'end_time' => 615.598, 'target_text' => 'I recall many years ago, someone had a Rolls-Royce.', 'source_text' => 'Saya teringat bertahun-tahun yang lalu, seseorang memiliki sebuah kereta Rolls-Royce.', 'order' => 181],
            ['start_time' => 615.698, 'end_time' => 616.298, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan cuba teka apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 182],
            ['start_time' => 616.398, 'end_time' => 621.898, 'target_text' => 'When Rolls-Royce wanted to repair the vehicle, they covered the car in a canvas before they took it because they didn\'t want', 'source_text' => 'Tatkala pihak Rolls-Royce ingin membaiki kenderaan tersebut, mereka menutup kereta itu dengan kain kanvas sebelum menundanya, kerana mereka tidak mahu —', 'order' => 183],
            ['start_time' => 621.998, 'end_time' => 623.598, 'target_text' => 'according to us when we were kids.', 'source_text' => 'mengikut cerita semasa kami masih kanak-kanak dahulu —', 'order' => 184],
            ['start_time' => 623.698, 'end_time' => 627.398, 'target_text' => 'They say they didn\'t want anyone to know that a Rolls-Royce got stuck.', 'source_text' => 'mereka berkata mereka tidak mahu sesiapa pun tahu bahawa sebuah Rolls-Royce boleh tersadai di tepi jalan.', 'order' => 185],
            ['start_time' => 627.498, 'end_time' => 628.198, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows best.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Maha Mengetahui.', 'order' => 186],
            ['start_time' => 628.298, 'end_time' => 629.898, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t know whether it\'s true or not.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak pasti sama ada kisah itu benar atau sekadar mitos.', 'order' => 187],
            ['start_time' => 629.998, 'end_time' => 632.198, 'target_text' => 'But nonetheless, the same applies with us.', 'source_text' => 'Namun demikian, pengajaran yang sama berlaku dalam kehidupan kita.', 'order' => 188],
            ['start_time' => 632.298, 'end_time' => 634.698, 'target_text' => 'We have something more valuable than a Rolls-Royce.', 'source_text' => 'Kita memiliki maruah yang jauh lebih berharga daripada sebuah Rolls-Royce.', 'order' => 189],
            ['start_time' => 634.798, 'end_time' => 636.898, 'target_text' => 'Why do you want to wash your linen in public?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah anda mahu menjaja aib dan pekung rumah tangga anda di khalayak ramai?', 'order' => 190],
            ['start_time' => 636.998, 'end_time' => 640.598, 'target_text' => 'The whole of Harari needs to know that these two are having marital problems.', 'source_text' => 'Adakah seluruh penduduk Harare perlu tahu bahawa pasangan ini sedang menghadapi krisis rumah tangga?', 'order' => 191],
            ['start_time' => 640.698, 'end_time' => 641.498, 'target_text' => 'For what?', 'source_text' => 'Untuk apa?', 'order' => 192],
            ['start_time' => 641.598, 'end_time' => 642.598, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa perlu dijaja?', 'order' => 193],
            ['start_time' => 642.698, 'end_time' => 643.998, 'target_text' => 'Oh, these people are having issues.', 'source_text' => '\'Oh, keluarga ini sedang menghadapi masalah besar.\'', 'order' => 194],
            ['start_time' => 644.098, 'end_time' => 645.198, 'target_text' => 'May Allah protect us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah melindungi kita semua.', 'order' => 195],
            ['start_time' => 645.298, 'end_time' => 646.998, 'target_text' => 'May Allah grant us ease and goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mengurniakan kita kemudahan dan kebaikan.', 'order' => 196],
            ['start_time' => 647.098, 'end_time' => 651.998, 'target_text' => 'Cover, cover and try your best not to go and announce to the world we\'re having problems.', 'source_text' => 'Tutuplah aib, peliharalah rahsia, dan berusahalah sedaya upaya untuk tidak mengumumkan kepada seluruh dunia bahawa kita sedang menghadapi masalah.', 'order' => 197],
            ['start_time' => 652.098, 'end_time' => 655.598, 'target_text' => 'The world, they will not be happy at the solution.', 'source_text' => 'Masyarakat luar sering kali tidak gembira melihat jalan penyelesaian anda.', 'order' => 198],
            ['start_time' => 655.698, 'end_time' => 658.998, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes they have something to gain because of your weakness.', 'source_text' => 'Malah kadangkala mereka mendapat keuntungan di atas kelemahan dan perpecahan anda.', 'order' => 199],
            ['start_time' => 659.098, 'end_time' => 660.398, 'target_text' => 'Look at the Zionist out there.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah puak Zionis di luar sana.', 'order' => 200],
            ['start_time' => 660.498, 'end_time' => 665.598, 'target_text' => 'Is he not gaining directly by the dispute among the members of the Ummah?', 'source_text' => 'Tidakkah mereka mendapat keuntungan secara langsung daripada perpecahan yang melanda anggota ummah ini?', 'order' => 201],
            ['start_time' => 665.698, 'end_time' => 670.598, 'target_text' => 'Gaza has happened simply because WE ARE SO DIVIDED THAT WE DIDN\'T CARE.', 'source_text' => 'Tragedi di Gaza berlaku semata-mata kerana KITA BEGITU BERPECAH-BELAH SEHINGGA KITA HILANG RASA PEDULI.', 'order' => 202],
            ['start_time' => 670.698, 'end_time' => 675.998, 'target_text' => 'If we were united, I still believe it would have never ever happened.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya kita bersatu padu, saya tetap yakin bahawa malapetaka itu sama sekali tidak akan berlaku.', 'order' => 203],
            ['start_time' => 676.098, 'end_time' => 678.398, 'target_text' => 'And we should say it because we have not learned lessons.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita wajib menyatakan kebenaran ini kerana kita masih belum mengambil iktibar daripadanya.', 'order' => 204],
            ['start_time' => 678.498, 'end_time' => 681.598, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the reason why I\'m talking about resolving problems today.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sebabnya mengapa hari ini saya berbicara mengenai kepentingan mendamaikan dan menyelesaikan persengketaan.', 'order' => 205],
            ['start_time' => 681.698, 'end_time' => 684.698, 'target_text' => 'Grassroots, it starts off spouse.', 'source_text' => 'Dari akar umbi, ia bermula antara pasangan suami isteri.', 'order' => 206],
            ['start_time' => 684.798, 'end_time' => 689.098, 'target_text' => 'Then it goes on, like I said, and on and on and the circle grows grows bigger.', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian ia berkembang, seperti yang saya sebutkan, lingkaran perpecahan itu menjadi semakin besar dan luas.', 'order' => 207],
            ['start_time' => 689.198, 'end_time' => 691.898, 'target_text' => 'And then members of the Ummah.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu menjalar kepada sesama anggota ummah.', 'order' => 208],
            ['start_time' => 691.998, 'end_time' => 698.598, 'target_text' => 'And on top of that, even others who might not be Muslim whom you are living with or your neighbors, etc., you must try and', 'source_text' => 'Bahkan selain itu, terhadap orang bukan Islam yang hidup berjiran dengan anda sekalipun, anda wajib berusaha', 'order' => 209],
            ['start_time' => 698.698, 'end_time' => 702.298, 'target_text' => 'have a good relation where rights are fulfilled in the best way.', 'source_text' => 'menjalinkan hubungan yang baik di mana hak-hak bersama disempurnakan dengan cara yang paling mulia.', 'order' => 210],
            ['start_time' => 702.398, 'end_time' => 705.898, 'target_text' => 'When there\'s a dispute, you try to resolve it in the best possible way.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila timbul perselisihan, berusahalah menyelesaikannya dengan kaedah yang terbaik.', 'order' => 211],
            ['start_time' => 705.998, 'end_time' => 711.498, 'target_text' => 'Speak and speak again and address them and communicate again and again and try again.', 'source_text' => 'Bercakaplah, berbincanglah semula, dekati mereka, dan berkomunikasilah berulang kali demi mencari titik temu.', 'order' => 212],
            ['start_time' => 711.598, 'end_time' => 718.598, 'target_text' => 'Today, the wars that are taking place on Earth, those that we know of and those that we don\'t know of, don\'t you agree that', 'source_text' => 'Hari ini, peperangan yang sedang melanda dunia — sama ada yang kita ketahui mahupun yang tersembunyi — tidakkah anda bersetuju bahawa', 'order' => 213],
            ['start_time' => 718.698, 'end_time' => 721.898, 'target_text' => 'one of the best ways of solving it is go and talk to them live and direct.', 'source_text' => 'salah satu jalan terbaik untuk menyelesaikannya adalah pergi bersemuka dan berbincang secara langsung dengan mereka?', 'order' => 214],
            ['start_time' => 721.998, 'end_time' => 722.998, 'target_text' => 'Listen, what\'s the matter?', 'source_text' => 'Dengar dahulu, apakah masalah sebenarnya?', 'order' => 215],
            ['start_time' => 723.098, 'end_time' => 724.598, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s sit and let\'s resolve it.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah kita duduk semeja dan selesaikan perkara ini.', 'order' => 216],
            ['start_time' => 724.698, 'end_time' => 730.198, 'target_text' => 'And I am wrong and you are wrong or I am right and you are right and you discuss and you come to a solution.', 'source_text' => '\'Saya mungkin ada salahnya dan anda juga ada salahnya, atau saya betul dalam aspek ini dan anda betul dalam aspek itu,\' lalu anda bincang dan capai kesepakatan.', 'order' => 217],
            ['start_time' => 730.298, 'end_time' => 733.999, 'target_text' => 'Finding the solution, you might have to give and take a few things here and there.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam mencari jalan penyelesaian, anda mungkin perlu bertolak ansur (give and take) dalam beberapa perkara di sana sini.', 'order' => 218],
            ['start_time' => 734.099, 'end_time' => 739.399, 'target_text' => 'There is a dispute, for example, of some amount you owe someone else and the matter becomes big.', 'source_text' => 'Katakanlah berlaku pertikaian mengenai sejumlah hutang yang anda berhutang kepada seseorang, dan perkara itu menjadi tegang.', 'order' => 219],
            ['start_time' => 739.499, 'end_time' => 741.199, 'target_text' => 'It doesn\'t mean you stop owing them.', 'source_text' => 'Itu tidak bermakna anda boleh terus lepas tangan daripada membayar hutang tersebut.', 'order' => 220],
            ['start_time' => 741.299, 'end_time' => 742.299, 'target_text' => 'Did you hear the talk?', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah anda mendengar perbualan seperti ini?', 'order' => 221],
            ['start_time' => 742.399, 'end_time' => 743.899, 'target_text' => 'Now just forgive me and let\'s solve the problem.', 'source_text' => '\'Sekarang maafkanlah saya dan marilah kita anggap masalah ini selesai.\'', 'order' => 222],
            ['start_time' => 743.999, 'end_time' => 746.399, 'target_text' => 'Brother, you owe the guy half a million dollars.', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudaraku, kamu berhutang dengan orang itu setengah juta dolar!', 'order' => 223],
            ['start_time' => 746.499, 'end_time' => 748.399, 'target_text' => 'Where\'s the money?', 'source_text' => 'Di manakah wangnya?', 'order' => 224],
            ['start_time' => 748.499, 'end_time' => 749.399, 'target_text' => 'So let\'s make a solution.', 'source_text' => 'Maka marilah kita cari jalan keluar yang munasabah.', 'order' => 225],
            ['start_time' => 749.499, 'end_time' => 755.799, 'target_text' => 'Pay me so much a month or let\'s have a guarantor, someone who can actually guarantee this amount for a something.', 'source_text' => 'Bayarlah secara ansuran sekian jumlah setiap bulan, atau sediakan seorang penjamin yang benar-benar mampu menjamin bayaran tersebut.', 'order' => 226],
            ['start_time' => 755.899, 'end_time' => 757.899, 'target_text' => 'Solve it some way.', 'source_text' => 'Selesaikanlah dengan jalan yang adil.', 'order' => 227],
            ['start_time' => 757.999, 'end_time' => 766.199, 'target_text' => 'So if both parties would like the solution, Allah says the solution shall be found because they will understand I must correct', 'source_text' => 'Maka sekiranya kedua-dua pihak ikhlas menginginkan perdamaian, Allah menegaskan bahawa jalan penyelesaian pasti akan ditemui kerana mereka sedar: daku wajib membetulkan', 'order' => 228],
            ['start_time' => 766.299, 'end_time' => 768.499, 'target_text' => 'myself according to the pleasure of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'diri daku demi meraih keredaan Allah.', 'order' => 229],
            ['start_time' => 768.599, 'end_time' => 771.099, 'target_text' => 'I must admit according to the pleasure of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Daku wajib mengakui kesilapan daku demi mencari keredaan Allah.', 'order' => 230],
            ['start_time' => 771.199, 'end_time' => 773.999, 'target_text' => 'A little bit of give give and take, free play.', 'source_text' => 'Perlu ada sedikit tolak ansur, kelonggaran dalam pergerakan.', 'order' => 231],
            ['start_time' => 774.099, 'end_time' => 776.099, 'target_text' => 'It\'s called free play.', 'source_text' => 'Ia diibaratkan seperti ruang main bebas (free play) pada stereng kenderaan.', 'order' => 232],
            ['start_time' => 776.199, 'end_time' => 781.399, 'target_text' => 'You know, when you have a brand new motor vehicle, the minute you touch the steering, it moves to the right or left depending', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, apabila anda memandu kenderaan serba baharu, sebaik sahaja anda menyentuh sterengnya sedikit, ia terus membelok ke kanan atau ke kiri bergantung', 'order' => 233],
            ['start_time' => 781.499, 'end_time' => 782.799, 'target_text' => 'on which way you swayed it.', 'source_text' => 'ke arah mana anda memusingkannya.', 'order' => 234],
            ['start_time' => 782.899, 'end_time' => 788.799, 'target_text' => 'If you have a 1960 vehicle, 1970, you can turn it 30 whole degrees and the thing is still going straight.', 'source_text' => 'Namun jika anda memandu kereta lama tahun 1960-an atau 1970-an, anda boleh pusingkan sterengnya sehingga 30 darjah penuh dan kereta itu masih lagi bergerak lurus ke hadapan.', 'order' => 235],
            ['start_time' => 788.899, 'end_time' => 790.499, 'target_text' => 'That\'s called free play, right?', 'source_text' => 'Itulah yang dinamakan \'free play\' (ruang kelonggaran), bukan?', 'order' => 236],
            ['start_time' => 790.599, 'end_time' => 796.199, 'target_text' => 'So we have to compromise a little bit here and there because sometimes you move a bit this way or that way, it\'s okay.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kita perlu bertolak ansur sedikit di sana sini, kerana kadangkala jika beralih sedikit ke arah ini atau ke arah itu, ia tidak mengapa.', 'order' => 237],
            ['start_time' => 796.299, 'end_time' => 798.599, 'target_text' => 'You gain, I gain, it\'s all one and the same thing.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mendapat faedah, saya mendapat faedah, pada akhirnya kita berdua berkongsi kebaikan yang sama.', 'order' => 238],
            ['start_time' => 798.699, 'end_time' => 805.599, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes we fight over $100 in a way that we\'ve spent $10,000 to retrieve the 100.', 'source_text' => 'Kadang-kadang kita bertelingkah kerana wang sebanyak $100 sehinggakan kita sanggup menghabiskan $10,000 semata-mata untuk menuntut kembali $100 itu.', 'order' => 239],
            ['start_time' => 805.699, 'end_time' => 809.199, 'target_text' => 'What you rather do, forgive the 100 and greet the person, say thank you very much.', 'source_text' => 'Tidakkah lebih baik sekiranya anda halalkan sahaja $100 itu, lemparkan senyuman kepada orang tersebut dan ucapkan: \'Terima kasih banyak-banyak\'?', 'order' => 240],
            ['start_time' => 809.299, 'end_time' => 811.399, 'target_text' => 'Make sure they don\'t ever deal with you again.', 'source_text' => 'Dan pastikan selepas itu mereka tidak lagi berurusan perniagaan dengan anda.', 'order' => 241],
            ['start_time' => 811.499, 'end_time' => 812.499, 'target_text' => 'That\'s not wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Tindakan itu sama sekali tidak salah.', 'order' => 242],
            ['start_time' => 812.599, 'end_time' => 816.699, 'target_text' => 'To say listen, we solved the matter, agreed to, you are my brother, but I don\'t want to do business with you again.', 'source_text' => 'Untuk berkata: \'Dengar sini, kita telah selesaikan isu ini, kita sepakat berdamai, kamu tetap saudara saya, tetapi saya tidak mahu lagi berniaga dengan kamu.\'', 'order' => 243],
            ['start_time' => 816.799, 'end_time' => 817.799, 'target_text' => 'Is there anything wrong with that?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah terdapat sebarang kesalahan dengan pendirian tersebut?', 'order' => 244],
            ['start_time' => 817.899, 'end_time' => 818.399, 'target_text' => 'Nothing wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada apa yang salah sama sekali.', 'order' => 245],
            ['start_time' => 818.499, 'end_time' => 819.699, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t need to do business.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak wajib meneruskan urusan perniagaan dengannya.', 'order' => 246],
            ['start_time' => 819.799, 'end_time' => 820.999, 'target_text' => 'Once bitten, twice shy.', 'source_text' => 'Sekali terkena, dua kali beringat (once bitten, twice shy).', 'order' => 247],
            ['start_time' => 821.099, 'end_time' => 823.599, 'target_text' => 'That\'s an Islamic teaching.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah ajaran Islam yang sahih.', 'order' => 248],
            ['start_time' => 825.599, 'end_time' => 828.399, 'target_text' => 'A believer is never bitten from the same hole twice.', 'source_text' => 'Seorang mukmin tidak akan disengat dari lubang yang sama sebanyak dua kali.', 'order' => 249],
            ['start_time' => 828.499, 'end_time' => 830.199, 'target_text' => 'So forgive by all means.', 'source_text' => 'Maka maafkanlah dengan sepenuh hati.', 'order' => 250],
            ['start_time' => 830.299, 'end_time' => 831.699, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t forget.', 'source_text' => 'Namun jangan mudah lupa.', 'order' => 251],
            ['start_time' => 831.799, 'end_time' => 832.399, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t forget.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan lupa iktibar daripadanya.', 'order' => 252],
            ['start_time' => 832.499, 'end_time' => 833.899, 'target_text' => 'Always remember what happened.', 'source_text' => 'Sentiasalah ingat apa yang pernah berlaku sebagai pengajaran.', 'order' => 253],
            ['start_time' => 833.999, 'end_time' => 836.799, 'target_text' => 'Even when you old, remember it because it might happen again.', 'source_text' => 'Walaupun tatkala anda telah tua kelak, beringatlah kerana perkara yang sama boleh berulang lagi.', 'order' => 254],
            ['start_time' => 836.899, 'end_time' => 839.599, 'target_text' => 'But Allah makes you forget.', 'source_text' => 'Namun Allah juga yang mengurniakan nikmat lupa kepada anda.', 'order' => 255],
            ['start_time' => 839.699, 'end_time' => 844.699, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes certain things have happened when you younger and you can\'t even remember it until you are reminded again and you', 'source_text' => 'Kadang-kadang ada perkara tertentu yang berlaku semasa anda masih muda, dan anda langsung tidak dapat mengingatnya sehinggalah seseorang mengingatkan anda kembali, lalu', 'order' => 256],
            ['start_time' => 844.799, 'end_time' => 845.799, 'target_text' => 'say ah I can\'t really recall.', 'source_text' => 'anda berkata: \'Ah, saya betul-betul tak dapat ingat.\'', 'order' => 257],
            ['start_time' => 845.899, 'end_time' => 847.099, 'target_text' => 'Okay, yeah, yeah, yeah.', 'source_text' => '\'Baiklah, ya, ya, sekarang baru saya teringat masa kita budak-budak dulu, ada berlaku perkara ini dan itu.\'', 'order' => 258],
            ['start_time' => 847.199, 'end_time' => 849.199, 'target_text' => 'I remember we were kids and this happened and that happened.', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah yang membuatkan anda melupakan kepahitan itu?', 'order' => 259],
            ['start_time' => 849.299, 'end_time' => 849.999, 'target_text' => 'Who made you forget?', 'source_text' => 'Allah SWT.', 'order' => 260],
            ['start_time' => 850.099, 'end_time' => 850.699, 'target_text' => 'Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya hanyalah seorang manusia.', 'order' => 261],
            ['start_time' => 850.799, 'end_time' => 851.399, 'target_text' => 'I\'m a human.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sememangnya sukar untuk melupakan perbuatan orang yang pernah mengkhianati atau menikam saya dari belakang.', 'order' => 262],
            ['start_time' => 851.499, 'end_time' => 853.799, 'target_text' => 'I can\'t really forget someone who stabbed me.', 'source_text' => 'Saya akan sentiasa ingat sekalipun hubungan kami telah bertambah baik, namun sekiranya hubungan itu pulih dengan begitu indah sehingga kami saling berurusan,', 'order' => 263],
            ['start_time' => 853.899, 'end_time' => 860.101, 'target_text' => 'I will always remember even if the relationship has become better, but if the relationship becomes so good that we dealt and', 'source_text' => 'kami mendamaikan masalah, kami saling memahami, lama-kelamaan saya mungkin benar-benar melupakan bahawa kami pernah bertelingkah suatu ketika dahulu.', 'order' => 264],
            ['start_time' => 860.201, 'end_time' => 864.801, 'target_text' => 'we resolved and we saw and we saw, I may forget that we ever had a problem.', 'source_text' => 'Itu semua adalah sebahagian daripada perancangan hikmah Allah.', 'order' => 265],
            ['start_time' => 864.901, 'end_time' => 866.601, 'target_text' => 'That\'s part of Allah\'s plan.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kita kemudahan dan kebaikan.', 'order' => 266],
            ['start_time' => 866.701, 'end_time' => 869.101, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us ease and goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudara-saudari yang saya kasihi sekalian, begitu juga satu lagi tonggak utama dalam mendamaikan persengketaan adalah keupayaan', 'order' => 267],
            ['start_time' => 869.201, 'end_time' => 878.501, 'target_text' => 'My beloved brothers, my sisters, similarly, another another cornerstone of resolving the matter is to be able to', 'source_text' => 'melantik orang yang anda percayai sebagai individu yang amanah serta dihormati oleh kedua-dua belah pihak, dan mereka mampu membimbing', 'order' => 268],
            ['start_time' => 878.601, 'end_time' => 887.901, 'target_text' => 'appoint those whom you believe are trustworthy people who are respected by both parties and then they would be able to navigate', 'source_text' => 'ke arah mencari jalan penyelesaian yang adil lagi saksama.', 'order' => 269],
            ['start_time' => 888.001, 'end_time' => 893.001, 'target_text' => 'through finding a solution that is just and fair.', 'source_text' => 'Dan Allah berfirman mengenai pertikaian antara suami dan isteri,', 'order' => 270],
            ['start_time' => 893.101, 'end_time' => 900.801, 'target_text' => 'And Allah says regarding regarding the dispute between husband and wife', 'source_text' => 'bahawa anda boleh melantik seorang hakam (pendamai) daripada pihak keluarga perempuan dan seorang daripada pihak keluarga lelaki, lalu biarkan kedua-duanya berbincang.', 'order' => 271],
            ['start_time' => 905.901, 'end_time' => 913.401, 'target_text' => 'that you can actually appoint a person, an arbitrator from her side and from his side and let the two of them talk.', 'source_text' => 'Prinsip yang sama terpakai dalam apa jua bentuk pertikaian.', 'order' => 272],
            ['start_time' => 913.501, 'end_time' => 915.701, 'target_text' => 'The same applies with any dispute.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya kaedah itu mampu membawa kepada perdamaian, insya-Allah ia pasti berjaya.', 'order' => 273],
            ['start_time' => 915.801, 'end_time' => 919.201, 'target_text' => 'If that is going to bring about solution, inshallah it will.', 'source_text' => 'Katakanlah anda mempunyai masalah dan anda tidak mahu bercakap terus dengan individu tersebut.', 'order' => 274],
            ['start_time' => 919.301, 'end_time' => 921.601, 'target_text' => 'Say you have a problem, you don\'t want to talk with someone.', 'source_text' => 'Ia juga sering berlaku dalam kancah politik antarabangsa.', 'order' => 275],
            ['start_time' => 921.701, 'end_time' => 923.901, 'target_text' => 'It happens in world politics also.', 'source_text' => 'Maka anda melantik wakil anda dan pihak sana melantik wakil mereka; para perantara ini akan duduk berbincang bersama dan kemudian pulang membawa', 'order' => 276],
            ['start_time' => 924.001, 'end_time' => 930.801, 'target_text' => 'So now you appoint someone and they appoint someone, the mediators go to talk to each other and they come back and they find', 'source_text' => 'jalan penyelesaian dengan izin Allah.', 'order' => 277],
            ['start_time' => 930.901, 'end_time' => 931.901, 'target_text' => 'a solution by the will of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Namun sekiranya penyelesaian itu berat sebelah dan tidak adil, ia tidak akan dapat meredakan kemelut tersebut.', 'order' => 278],
            ['start_time' => 932.001, 'end_time' => 935.901, 'target_text' => 'But if that solution is unfair, it will not resolve the matter.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ini membawa saya kepada poin yang ketiga.', 'order' => 279],
            ['start_time' => 936.001, 'end_time' => 938.001, 'target_text' => 'And that brings me to point number three.', 'source_text' => 'Sentiasalah berlaku adil dan saksama.', 'order' => 280],
            ['start_time' => 938.101, 'end_time' => 939.501, 'target_text' => 'Always be fair and just.', 'source_text' => 'Akui kesilapan anda di mana anda sememangnya bersalah.', 'order' => 281],
            ['start_time' => 939.601, 'end_time' => 941.501, 'target_text' => 'Admit your fault where you have to.', 'source_text' => 'Cuba lihat sesuatu perkara daripada sudut pandang pihak yang satu lagi, sama ada anda suka atau tidak, biarpun untuk seketika.', 'order' => 282],
            ['start_time' => 941.601, 'end_time' => 946.301, 'target_text' => 'Look at it from the other person\'s angle, whether you like it or not for a moment.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin akan melihat kebenaran buat pertama kalinya dalam sudut pandang yang berbeza sama sekali.', 'order' => 283],
            ['start_time' => 946.401, 'end_time' => 950.401, 'target_text' => 'You might just see the light for the first time in a different way.', 'source_text' => 'Anda bersengketa dengan seseorang dan anda langsung tidak menyedari bahawa sebenarnya anda yang silap manakala mereka di pihak yang benar.', 'order' => 284],
            ['start_time' => 950.501, 'end_time' => 954.501, 'target_text' => 'You have a dispute with someone and you don\'t realize actually you are wrong and they are right.', 'source_text' => 'Namun oleh kerana anda enggan melihat dari sudut pandang mereka, anda berkeras mempertahankan: \'Aku yang betul, dialah yang bersalah.\'', 'order' => 285],
            ['start_time' => 954.601, 'end_time' => 961.701, 'target_text' => 'But you because you didn\'t see their angle, you are bent on the fact that I am right, this person is wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Sedangkan mereka mempunyai naratif dan cerita yang berbeza sama sekali.', 'order' => 286],
            ['start_time' => 961.801, 'end_time' => 963.601, 'target_text' => 'And they have a totally different story.', 'source_text' => 'Baru-baru ini saya terlibat dalam satu sesi perdamaian (tahkim).', 'order' => 287],
            ['start_time' => 963.701, 'end_time' => 966.601, 'target_text' => 'Recently I was involved in an arbitration.', 'source_text' => 'Kami tidak berjaya mendamaikan kes tersebut semata-mata kerana kedua-dua belah pihak bercakap dari buku rujukan yang langsung berlainan.', 'order' => 288],
            ['start_time' => 966.701, 'end_time' => 972.901, 'target_text' => 'We did not succeed to resolve the matter simply because the two of them were reading from different books altogether.', 'source_text' => 'Tatkala anda bertanya kepada pihak pertama: \'Apakah masalahnya?\'', 'order' => 289],
            ['start_time' => 973.001, 'end_time' => 975.101, 'target_text' => 'When you go to one party, say what\'s the problem?', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menceritakan peristiwa yang kononnya berlaku di Honolulu.', 'order' => 290],
            ['start_time' => 975.201, 'end_time' => 978.001, 'target_text' => 'They are speaking about something that happened in Honolulu.', 'source_text' => 'Dan tatkala anda bertanya kepada pihak kedua apa yang berlaku, ia seolah-olah menceritakan kisah lain yang terjadi di Selatan India!', 'order' => 291],
            ['start_time' => 978.101, 'end_time' => 982.802, 'target_text' => 'And when ask the other party what happened, it\'s like something else happened in Southern India.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mengurniakan kita kemudahan.', 'order' => 292],
            ['start_time' => 982.902, 'end_time' => 984.102, 'target_text' => 'May Allah grant us ease.', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana boleh jadi begitu?', 'order' => 293],
            ['start_time' => 984.202, 'end_time' => 984.702, 'target_text' => 'How?', 'source_text' => 'Kedua-duanya kedengaran seperti dua kisah yang berbeza sama sekali.', 'order' => 294],
            ['start_time' => 984.802, 'end_time' => 986.902, 'target_text' => 'They sound like two totally different stories.', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila anda sampaikan cerita pihak pertama, pihak kedua mendakwa mereka menipu.', 'order' => 295],
            ['start_time' => 987.002, 'end_time' => 988.402, 'target_text' => 'And when you tell one, they say they\'re lying.', 'source_text' => 'Dan pihak yang satu lagi pula menuduh pihak lawannya menipu.', 'order' => 296],
            ['start_time' => 988.502, 'end_time' => 990.102, 'target_text' => 'And the other one, they say they\'re lying.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu anda berkata: \'Dengar sini, mesti ada titik tolak ansur di antara kamu berdua.\'', 'order' => 297],
            ['start_time' => 990.202, 'end_time' => 992.302, 'target_text' => 'And then you say, look, there has to be a compromise.', 'source_text' => 'Biar saya beritahu anda sesuatu.', 'order' => 298],
            ['start_time' => 992.402, 'end_time' => 994.202, 'target_text' => 'Tell you something.', 'source_text' => 'Pada kebiasaannya,', 'order' => 299],
            ['start_time' => 994.302, 'end_time' => 996.002, 'target_text' => 'Mostly,', 'source_text' => 'berusahalah mencari titik damai, penyelesaian, atau noktah pengakhiran dengan apa jua cara sekalipun.', 'order' => 300],
            ['start_time' => 996.102, 'end_time' => 1003.402, 'target_text' => 'try to find a resolve or a solution or a conclusion by hook or crook.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya sedar mengapa saya tekankan perkara ini di sini, kerana ia sangat mustahak.', 'order' => 301],
            ['start_time' => 1003.502, 'end_time' => 1005.602, 'target_text' => 'And I know I said that here because it\'s important.', 'source_text' => 'Kerap kali, berdamai itu jauh lebih baik untuk diri anda, untuk kesihatan tubuh, tidur malam anda, bacaan gula darah, buah pinggang, hati, paras kortisol, dan segenap kesihatan anda.', 'order' => 302],
            ['start_time' => 1005.702, 'end_time' => 1015.102, 'target_text' => 'Many, many times it\'s better for you, your health, your sleep, your sugar, your kidneys, your liver, your cortisol, your everything.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak menyedari bahawa tubuh anda sedang merosot secara perlahan-lahan semata-mata kerana anda menyimpan dendam kesumat di dalam hati.', 'order' => 303],
            ['start_time' => 1015.202, 'end_time' => 1019.402, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t realize your body is turning off because you have hate in your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Bahang api kebencian itu begitu toksik sehingga ia merosakkan kesihatan anda tanpa anda ketahui apakah puncanya.', 'order' => 304],
            ['start_time' => 1019.502, 'end_time' => 1024.502, 'target_text' => 'The heat of hatred is so bad that it affects your health and you don\'t know what\'s wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Terlalu banyak kebencian bersarang di dalam dada anda, wahai saudaraku.', 'order' => 305],
            ['start_time' => 1024.602, 'end_time' => 1026.502, 'target_text' => 'You have too much hatred in you, my brother.', 'source_text' => 'Ada kajian menyatakan bahawa mereka yang berumur panjang adalah golongan yang sentiasa tenang, santai, dan berlapang dada.', 'order' => 306],
            ['start_time' => 1026.602, 'end_time' => 1030.402, 'target_text' => 'They say those who live the longest are those who are calm and cool.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak pasti sejauh mana kebenarannya secara saintifik.', 'order' => 307],
            ['start_time' => 1030.502, 'end_time' => 1030.902, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi kita umat Islam, ajal itu sudah tentulah mutlak di tangan Allah.', 'order' => 308],
            ['start_time' => 1031.002, 'end_time' => 1033.402, 'target_text' => 'According to us, it\'s obviously the hands of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Namun pada kebanyakan waktu, seseorang yang tenang, santai, tidak mudah melenting, dan belajar memaafkan serta melepaskan perkara remeh, mutu kehidupan mereka jauh lebih', 'order' => 309],
            ['start_time' => 1033.502, 'end_time' => 1039.302, 'target_text' => 'But a lot of the time someone who\'s calm and cool and relaxed and they they they learning to forgo things, they are far better', 'source_text' => 'berkualiti dan bahagia.', 'order' => 310],
            ['start_time' => 1039.402, 'end_time' => 1041.302, 'target_text' => 'in terms of quality of life.', 'source_text' => 'Itu tidak bermakna Islam mengajar anda untuk terus-menerus memaafkan setiap waktu tanpa sempadan.', 'order' => 311],
            ['start_time' => 1041.402, 'end_time' => 1046.002, 'target_text' => 'That doesn\'t mean Islam teaches you to just forgive every single time.', 'source_text' => 'Saya yakin anda pasti pernah mendengar kisah seorang pemuda yang datang menemui tiga orang wali atau orang soleh yang sedang berdiri atau duduk', 'order' => 312],
            ['start_time' => 1046.102, 'end_time' => 1052.502, 'target_text' => 'I\'m sure you know the story of the youngster who came in and there were three holy people, pious people standing or sitting', 'source_text' => 'di saf pertama masjid sambil khusyuk beribadah, dan seseorang memberitahu pemuda itu bahawa mereka ini orang yang sangat warak — orang itu, orang ini dan yang seorang lagi.', 'order' => 313],
            ['start_time' => 1052.602, 'end_time' => 1058.502, 'target_text' => 'in the first suff and they were praying and someone told him these guys are pious, that guy, this guy and the other guy.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka begitu tenggelam dalam ibadah sehingga kononnya mereka tidak akan mampu,', 'order' => 314],
            ['start_time' => 1058.602, 'end_time' => 1063.302, 'target_text' => 'They won\'t even they won\'t even be able to, you know,', 'source_text' => 'merasai apa-apa kesakitan sekalipun sekiranya anda menampar mereka.', 'order' => 315],
            ['start_time' => 1063.402, 'end_time' => 1065.302, 'target_text' => 'feel if you were to slap them.', 'source_text' => 'Maka pemuda ini berkata dalam hatinya: \'Biar aku pergi tampar mereka.\'', 'order' => 316],
            ['start_time' => 1065.402, 'end_time' => 1067.202, 'target_text' => 'So this guy says, let me go slap them.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu dia menampar orang soleh yang pertama.', 'order' => 317],
            ['start_time' => 1067.302, 'end_time' => 1069.202, 'target_text' => 'He slapped the first one.', 'source_text' => 'Orang pertama itu langsung tidak mempedulikannya.', 'order' => 318],
            ['start_time' => 1069.302, 'end_time' => 1070.402, 'target_text' => 'He didn\'t notice.', 'source_text' => 'Beliau terus khusyuk berzikir mengingati Allah.', 'order' => 319],
            ['start_time' => 1070.502, 'end_time' => 1073.002, 'target_text' => 'The guy kept on doing his zikr.', 'source_text' => 'Beliau langsung tidak mengendahkan tamparan tersebut.', 'order' => 320],
            ['start_time' => 1073.102, 'end_time' => 1074.702, 'target_text' => 'The guy never noticed.', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian pemuda itu menampar orang yang kedua pula, kerana orang ramai memberitahu bahawa syeikh yang ini jauh lebih alim dan warak daripada yang pertama.', 'order' => 321],
            ['start_time' => 1074.802, 'end_time' => 1078.502, 'target_text' => 'He slapped the second one because they told him this guy is a bigger sheikh than the other one.', 'source_text' => 'Dia pun menampar lelaki kedua itu.', 'order' => 322],
            ['start_time' => 1078.602, 'end_time' => 1079.602, 'target_text' => 'He slapped the second guy.', 'source_text' => 'Lelaki kedua itu bingkas bangun, memandang ke arahnya dan bertanya: \'Bagaimanakah keadaan tanganmu? Adakah kamu berasa sakit?\'', 'order' => 323],
            ['start_time' => 1079.702, 'end_time' => 1082.102, 'target_text' => 'The second guy got up and he looks at him. He says, how\'s your hand?', 'source_text' => '\'Kamu pasti kamu tidak apa-apa?\'', 'order' => 324],
            ['start_time' => 1082.202, 'end_time' => 1083.402, 'target_text' => 'Are you sure you okay?', 'source_text' => 'Faham kan?', 'order' => 325],
            ['start_time' => 1083.502, 'end_time' => 1084.002, 'target_text' => 'You know?', 'source_text' => 'Lalu pemuda itu berkata: \'Wah, luar biasa sekali!\'', 'order' => 326],
            ['start_time' => 1084.102, 'end_time' => 1085.202, 'target_text' => 'He said, oh, wow.', 'source_text' => '\'Tengoklah orang ini.\'', 'order' => 327],
            ['start_time' => 1085.302, 'end_time' => 1086.202, 'target_text' => 'Look at this guy.', 'source_text' => '\'Beliau sememangnya seorang yang sangat warak.\'', 'order' => 328],
            ['start_time' => 1086.302, 'end_time' => 1088.602, 'target_text' => 'He is actually so pious.', 'source_text' => '\'Beliau lebih risaukan kesakitan tangan aku daripada pipinya yang ditampar.\'', 'order' => 329],
            ['start_time' => 1088.702, 'end_time' => 1091.902, 'target_text' => 'He\'s more worried about my hand than his face.', 'source_text' => 'Maka dengan penuh yakin dia pergi pula kepada orang soleh yang ketiga, sambil berfikir apakah reaksi yang bakal ditunjukkan.', 'order' => 330],
            ['start_time' => 1092.002, 'end_time' => 1096.602, 'target_text' => 'So then he pitches up by the third guy and he says, I wonder what he\'s going to do.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu dia memberikan SATU TAMPARAN yang kuat.', 'order' => 331],
            ['start_time' => 1096.702, 'end_time' => 1097.802, 'target_text' => 'He gave him ONE SLAP.', 'source_text' => 'Lelaki ketiga itu terus bingkas berdiri dan MEMBALAS KEPADANYA DUA TAMPARAN YANG PADU DAN PANAS!', 'order' => 332],
            ['start_time' => 1097.902, 'end_time' => 1102.003, 'target_text' => 'THAT guy got up and gave HIM BACK TWO HARD, HOT', 'source_text' => 'PEMUDA ITU BERTERIAK: \'TETAPI SAYA SANGKAKAN TUAN JAUH LEBIH WARAK DARIPADA DUA ORANG TADI!\'', 'order' => 333],
            ['start_time' => 1102.103, 'end_time' => 1104.803, 'target_text' => 'HE SAID, BUT I THOUGHT YOU ARE MORE PIOUS THAN THE OTHER TWO.', 'source_text' => 'Lelaki itu menjawab: \'Benar, tetapi mesti ada seseorang yang mengajar kamu dan menghentikan perbuatan biadab kamu!\'', 'order' => 334],
            ['start_time' => 1104.903, 'end_time' => 1106.703, 'target_text' => 'He says, yes, someone has to stop you.', 'source_text' => '\'Kamu tidak boleh sewenang-wenangnya berjalan ke sana ke mari menampar semua orang soleh!\'', 'order' => 335],
            ['start_time' => 1106.803, 'end_time' => 1110.203, 'target_text' => 'You can\'t go around slapping all pious people.', 'source_text' => 'Dan itulah hakikat kehidupan sebenar.', 'order' => 336],
            ['start_time' => 1110.403, 'end_time' => 1111.103, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s the fact.', 'source_text' => 'Inilah perkara yang berlaku dalam realiti dunia.', 'order' => 337],
            ['start_time' => 1111.203, 'end_time' => 1112.403, 'target_text' => 'This is what happens in life.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kita kemudahan.', 'order' => 338],
            ['start_time' => 1112.503, 'end_time' => 1114.603, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us ease.', 'source_text' => 'Maka sekiranya seseorang berhutang kepada anda sesuatu,', 'order' => 339],
            ['start_time' => 1114.703, 'end_time' => 1116.603, 'target_text' => 'So someone owes you something.', 'source_text' => 'atau berlaku sesuatu kezaliman,', 'order' => 340],
            ['start_time' => 1116.703, 'end_time' => 1117.403, 'target_text' => 'Something happened.', 'source_text' => 'Islam tidak pernah mengajar anda untuk sekadar memaafkan secara membuta tuli sepanjang masa.', 'order' => 341],
            ['start_time' => 1117.503, 'end_time' => 1119.903, 'target_text' => 'Islam does not teach you to just forgive all the time.', 'source_text' => 'Sikap pasif sebegitu mungkin hanya akan menggalakkan mereka terus menindas orang lain.', 'order' => 342],
            ['start_time' => 1120.003, 'end_time' => 1121.303, 'target_text' => 'You could be encouraging them.', 'source_text' => 'Kadang-kadang anda WAJIB MENGAMBIL TINDAKAN TEGAS SEMATA-MATA KERANA kezaliman itu mesti dihentikan.', 'order' => 343],
            ['start_time' => 1121.403, 'end_time' => 1126.203, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes you have to take people TO TASK SIMPLY BECAUSE it must stop.', 'source_text' => 'Ia tidak boleh dibiarkan berterusan begitu sahaja.', 'order' => 344],
            ['start_time' => 1126.303, 'end_time' => 1127.603, 'target_text' => 'It can\'t go on.', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda faham mesej yang saya sampaikan ini?', 'order' => 345],
            ['start_time' => 1127.703, 'end_time' => 1128.503, 'target_text' => 'Do you get the point?', 'source_text' => 'Kadang-kadang ada orang menegur: \'Mengapakah kamu bertindak begitu keras dan tidak bertolak ansur?\'', 'order' => 346],
            ['start_time' => 1128.603, 'end_time' => 1130.703, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes you have people say, why are you being unreasonable?', 'source_text' => 'Anda tegaskan kepada mereka: \'Ini sudah kali keempat perkara ini berlaku!\'', 'order' => 347],
            ['start_time' => 1130.803, 'end_time' => 1133.503, 'target_text' => 'You tell them this is the fourth time it\'s happening.', 'source_text' => '\'Kita tidak boleh membiarkannya berulang lagi kerana ia telah memangsakan begitu ramai orang.\'', 'order' => 348],
            ['start_time' => 1133.603, 'end_time' => 1135.503, 'target_text' => 'We can\'t allow it\'s happened to so many people.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala Allah menganugerahkan anda kekuatan dan kedudukan untuk bangkit menentang kezaliman.', 'order' => 349],
            ['start_time' => 1135.603, 'end_time' => 1139.403, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes Allah gives you the capacity to stand up against tyranny.', 'source_text' => 'Maka anda wajib bangkit melawan kezaliman tersebut kerana si zalim itu telah menindas ramai insan lain yang tidak berdaya untuk bangkit mempertahankan diri.', 'order' => 350],
            ['start_time' => 1139.503, 'end_time' => 1145.303, 'target_text' => 'You have to stand up against tyranny because that tyrant did it to so many others who did not have the ability to stand up.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, perkara ini juga wajib diambil kira secara adil.', 'order' => 351],
            ['start_time' => 1145.403, 'end_time' => 1147.903, 'target_text' => 'So this is also taken into consideration.', 'source_text' => 'Namun begitu wahai saudara-saudariku, bersikap adil dan saksama adalah prinsip mutlak yang sentiasa diajarkan oleh Islam.', 'order' => 352],
            ['start_time' => 1148.003, 'end_time' => 1153.803, 'target_text' => 'But my brothers and sisters, being fair and just is something that Islam teaches.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, pada setiap hari Jumaat kita pasti mendengar sepotong ayat al-Quran dibacakan.', 'order' => 353],
            ['start_time' => 1153.903, 'end_time' => 1156.003, 'target_text' => 'You know, every Friday we hear a verse.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin pada hari ini pun anda akan mendengarnya dalam khutbah Jumaat.', 'order' => 354],
            ['start_time' => 1156.103, 'end_time' => 1159.403, 'target_text' => 'You may hear it today also in the khutbah.', 'source_text' => 'Apakah maksud ayat tersebut?', 'order' => 355],
            ['start_time' => 1172.603, 'end_time' => 1174.703, 'target_text' => 'What does it mean?', 'source_text' => 'Ia bukan sekadar menandakan bahawa khutbah Jumaat sudah hampir tamat.', 'order' => 356],
            ['start_time' => 1175.003, 'end_time' => 1178.203, 'target_text' => 'It doesn\'t mean that the Jumu\'ah khutbah has come to an end.', 'source_text' => 'Biasanya anak-anak muda tidak memahami apakah maksud sebenar bacaan tersebut.', 'order' => 357],
            ['start_time' => 1178.303, 'end_time' => 1180.303, 'target_text' => 'Usually the youngsters don\'t know what anything means.', 'source_text' => 'Khatib sedang membaca ayat dalam bahasa Arab,', 'order' => 358],
            ['start_time' => 1180.403, 'end_time' => 1181.803, 'target_text' => 'The Arabic is being spoken.', 'source_text' => 'sedangkan hanya lima orang sahaja dalam kalangan jemaah yang benar-benar memahami bahasa Arab.', 'order' => 359],
            ['start_time' => 1181.903, 'end_time' => 1183.203, 'target_text' => 'Five people in the crowd know Arabic.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaik sahaja mendengar ayat itu, mereka berasa sangat gembira.', 'order' => 360],
            ['start_time' => 1183.303, 'end_time' => 1185.403, 'target_text' => 'The minute they hear they so happy.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaik sahaja mendengar ayat itu, mereka berasa sangat gembira.', 'order' => 361],
            ['start_time' => 1185.503, 'end_time' => 1190.503, 'target_text' => 'They start fixing up all the things, put the phone in the pocket, get ready to stand up because for them that means the khutbah', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mula mengemas barang-barang, memasukkan telefon ke dalam poket, dan bersiap-sedia untuk berdiri kerana bagi mereka itu tandanya khutbah', 'order' => 362],
            ['start_time' => 1190.603, 'end_time' => 1191.803, 'target_text' => 'is ended.', 'source_text' => 'sudah selesai.', 'order' => 363],
            ['start_time' => 1191.903, 'end_time' => 1196.203, 'target_text' => 'In actual fact, it\'s one of the most powerful verses that you will ever come across.', 'source_text' => 'Padahal hakikatnya, itulah salah satu ayat yang paling agung dan mendalam yang pernah anda temui di dalam al-Quran.', 'order' => 364],
            ['start_time' => 1196.303, 'end_time' => 1203.803, 'target_text' => 'It means Allah instructs you, oh members of the Ummah, to be just and to be kind.', 'source_text' => 'Ayat itu bermaksud: Sesungguhnya Allah memerintahkan kamu, wahai seluruh anggota ummah, agar berlaku adil dan berbuat kebajikan,', 'order' => 365],
            ['start_time' => 1205.003, 'end_time' => 1206.703, 'target_text' => 'And to give your relatives.', 'source_text' => 'serta memberi bantuan kepada kaum kerabat.', 'order' => 366],
            ['start_time' => 1206.803, 'end_time' => 1207.202, 'target_text' => 'Wow.', 'source_text' => 'SubhanAllah, perhatikanlah!', 'order' => 367],
            ['start_time' => 1207.203, 'end_time' => 1208.603, 'target_text' => 'Give your relatives.', 'source_text' => 'Bantulah kaum kerabatmu terlebih dahulu.', 'order' => 368],
            ['start_time' => 1208.703, 'end_time' => 1216.203, 'target_text' => 'When people are poor and you giving your zakat, first circle you look around, your family, your own brothers, your own sisters.', 'source_text' => 'Tatkala orang ramai hidup dalam kemiskinan dan anda ingin mengeluarkan zakat, lingkaran pertama yang wajib anda perhatikan adalah ahli keluarga anda sendiri, adik-beradik kandung anda.', 'order' => 369],
            ['start_time' => 1216.303, 'end_time' => 1219.703, 'target_text' => 'You look around further, your uncles and aunts, perhaps your in-laws.', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian barulah anda luaskan pandangan kepada bapa saudara, ibu saudara, dan mungkin keluarga mentua anda.', 'order' => 370],
            ['start_time' => 1219.803, 'end_time' => 1223.103, 'target_text' => 'If they need wealth, don\'t go further than that circle.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya mereka memerlukan bantuan kewangan, janganlah anda hulurkan ke luar melepasi lingkaran keluarga terdekat itu terlebih dahulu.', 'order' => 371],
            ['start_time' => 1223.203, 'end_time' => 1223.705, 'target_text' => 'Remember this.', 'source_text' => 'Ingatlah pesanan ini baik-baik.', 'order' => 372],
            ['start_time' => 1223.805, 'end_time' => 1224.805, 'target_text' => 'it\'s an Islamic teaching.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah ajaran murni dalam Islam.', 'order' => 373],
            ['start_time' => 1224.905, 'end_time' => 1226.505, 'target_text' => 'First you look after your family.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulukanlah kebajikan keluarga terdekat anda.', 'order' => 374],
            ['start_time' => 1226.605, 'end_time' => 1230.905, 'target_text' => 'People say, oh, why did these people create an organization that looks after their own people?', 'source_text' => 'Ada orang bertanya: \'Mengapakah mereka menubuhkan pertubuhan kebajikan yang hanya membantu kaum kerabat mereka sendiri?\'', 'order' => 375],
            ['start_time' => 1231.005, 'end_time' => 1232.905, 'target_text' => 'Because that\'s the first instruction of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana itulah perintah Allah yang paling utama dan pertama sekali!', 'order' => 376],
            ['start_time' => 1233.005, 'end_time' => 1235.005, 'target_text' => 'Every community is supposed to have that.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap komuniti sepatutnya mempunyai sistem kebajikan keluarga seperti itu.', 'order' => 377],
            ['start_time' => 1235.105, 'end_time' => 1237.205, 'target_text' => 'Unfortunately, we don\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Namun malangnya, kebanyakan kita tidak memilikinya.', 'order' => 378],
            ['start_time' => 1237.305, 'end_time' => 1239.005, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us ease.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kita kemudahan.', 'order' => 379],
            ['start_time' => 1239.105, 'end_time' => 1240.105, 'target_text' => 'People suffer and struggle.', 'source_text' => 'Ramai insan di luar sana hidup menderita dan bergelut dengan kesusahan.', 'order' => 380],
            ['start_time' => 1240.205, 'end_time' => 1241.405, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t know where to turn.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka buntu tidak tahu ke mana arah hendak dituju,', 'order' => 381],
            ['start_time' => 1241.505, 'end_time' => 1243.005, 'target_text' => 'The families are wealthy.', 'source_text' => 'sedangkan keluarga mereka kaya-raya.', 'order' => 382],
            ['start_time' => 1243.105, 'end_time' => 1250.005, 'target_text' => 'It pains us to see that if you are a wealthy person and one of your family members are struggling, you are going to be questioned', 'source_text' => 'Amat memilukan hati kita apabila melihat sekiranya anda seorang yang berharta, namun ada dalam kalangan ahli keluarga anda sendiri yang sedang menderita kelaparan, anda pasti akan dipersoalkan', 'order' => 383],
            ['start_time' => 1250.105, 'end_time' => 1251.105, 'target_text' => 'by Allah.', 'source_text' => 'di hadapan Allah kelak.', 'order' => 384],
            ['start_time' => 1251.205, 'end_time' => 1257.405, 'target_text' => 'Even if you don\'t get along with that person, I know a brother so wealthy and he had a major dispute with his brother.', 'source_text' => 'Sekalipun anda tidak sehaluan atau bermusuh dengan individu tersebut — saya mengenali seorang hartawan yang sangat kaya dan dia berselisih faham teruk dengan saudara kandungnya.', 'order' => 385],
            ['start_time' => 1257.505, 'end_time' => 1263.005, 'target_text' => 'And his brother was so poor and he wanted to help because we\'d said that Allah will ask you.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saudaranya itu hidup dalam kemiskinan tegar, lalu si hartawan tadi ingin membantunya kerana dia sedar bahawa Allah akan menyoalnya di akhirat kelak.', 'order' => 386],
            ['start_time' => 1263.105, 'end_time' => 1271.105, 'target_text' => 'He helped that brother through a third party until one day years later the brother says, you know, when I was in need, you', 'source_text' => 'Maka dia membantu saudaranya itu secara rahsia melalui pihak ketiga, sehinggalah suatu hari bertahun-tahun kemudian, saudaranya itu mengadu: \'Tahu tak, masa aku susah dulu, kau sikit pun tak tolong aku.\'', 'order' => 387],
            ['start_time' => 1271.205, 'end_time' => 1272.005, 'target_text' => 'didn\'t even help me.', 'source_text' => '\'Orang luar yang langsung tak kenal pula yang datang menghulurkan bantuan.\'', 'order' => 388],
            ['start_time' => 1272.105, 'end_time' => 1274.805, 'target_text' => 'Another guy outside came to help.', 'source_text' => 'Si hartawan tadi hanya tersenyum tenang.', 'order' => 389],
            ['start_time' => 1274.905, 'end_time' => 1275.505, 'target_text' => 'He was smiling.', 'source_text' => 'Dia berkata: \'Pergilah tanya kepada orang luar itu dari manakah sebenarnya punca wang bantuan tersebut datang.\'', 'order' => 390],
            ['start_time' => 1275.605, 'end_time' => 1278.105, 'target_text' => 'He said, go ask the guy where it comes from.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu orang perantara itu memberitahu: \'Tahu tak,', 'order' => 391],
            ['start_time' => 1278.205, 'end_time' => 1279.105, 'target_text' => 'That guy says, you know what?', 'source_text' => 'saudara kandung kamulah yang mengirimkan wang belanja untuk kamu pada setiap bulan.\'', 'order' => 392],
            ['start_time' => 1279.205, 'end_time' => 1281.205, 'target_text' => 'Your brother gave me every month.', 'source_text' => 'Maka selesai dan terlerailah persengketaan tersebut.', 'order' => 393],
            ['start_time' => 1281.305, 'end_time' => 1282.605, 'target_text' => 'It solved the problem.', 'source_text' => 'Saya terfikir sekiranya dia berterus-terang sedikit awal, tentu masalah permusuhan itu dapat diselesaikan lebih awal, bukan?', 'order' => 394],
            ['start_time' => 1282.705, 'end_time' => 1287.605, 'target_text' => 'I was thinking that if he told him a little bit earlier, it could have solved the problem earlier, right?', 'source_text' => 'Namun walau apa pun, inilah hukum syariat Allah.', 'order' => 395],
            ['start_time' => 1287.705, 'end_time' => 1290.505, 'target_text' => 'But nonetheless, this is Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Allah memerintahkan anda agar berlaku adil dan berbuat ihsan.', 'order' => 396],
            ['start_time' => 1291.105, 'end_time' => 1293.205, 'target_text' => 'Allah asks you to be just and kind.', 'source_text' => 'Perhatikanlah susunan kalimah yang Allah gunakan.', 'order' => 397],
            ['start_time' => 1293.305, 'end_time' => 1294.005, 'target_text' => 'Look at the order.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak berfirman bahawa Dia memerintahkan kamu agar berbuat ihsan terlebih dahulu kemudian barulah berlaku adil, kerana jika demikian manusia akan beralasan: \'Oh, dia curi $100 sahaja.\'', 'order' => 398],
            ['start_time' => 1294.105, 'end_time' => 1299.805, 'target_text' => 'Allah didn\'t say Allah asks you to be kind and just because then people would say, oh, he stole 100 bucks.', 'source_text' => '\'Maafkan sahajalah dia.\'', 'order' => 399],
            ['start_time' => 1299.905, 'end_time' => 1300.705, 'target_text' => 'Just forgive him.', 'source_text' => '\'Berbuat baik sahajalah kepadanya.\'', 'order' => 400],
            ['start_time' => 1300.805, 'end_time' => 1301.305, 'target_text' => 'Just be kind.', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah Allah suruh berbuat ihsan?', 'order' => 401],
            ['start_time' => 1301.405, 'end_time' => 1302.205, 'target_text' => 'Allah says be kind.', 'source_text' => 'Namun Allah menegaskan: \'Tidak, Aku memerintahkan kamu agar menegakkan KEADILAN terlebih dahulu, kemudian barulah berbuat KEBAJIKAN (ihsan).\'', 'order' => 402],
            ['start_time' => 1302.305, 'end_time' => 1305.405, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, no, I ask you to be just first and then kind.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan sesekali melupakan ketetapan itu.', 'order' => 403],
            ['start_time' => 1305.505, 'end_time' => 1306.405, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t forget that.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah panduan hidup yang sangat bernilai.', 'order' => 404],
            ['start_time' => 1306.505, 'end_time' => 1307.605, 'target_text' => 'Very important teaching.', 'source_text' => 'Janganlah sembarangan mendesak seseorang: \'Maafkanlah, maafkanlah, maafkanlah.\'', 'order' => 405],
            ['start_time' => 1307.705, 'end_time' => 1310.305, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t go to someone and just say, forgive, forgive, forgive.', 'source_text' => 'Berapa banyak yang perlu dimaafkan?', 'order' => 406],
            ['start_time' => 1310.405, 'end_time' => 1311.105, 'target_text' => 'Forgive how much?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa lama hendak ditanggung?', 'order' => 407],
            ['start_time' => 1311.205, 'end_time' => 1312.105, 'target_text' => 'How long?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah hak yang sedang dipertaruhkan di sini?', 'order' => 408],
            ['start_time' => 1312.205, 'end_time' => 1313.705, 'target_text' => 'What is at stake here?', 'source_text' => 'Sebesar manakah kemudaratan yang telah berlaku?', 'order' => 409],
            ['start_time' => 1313.805, 'end_time' => 1314.705, 'target_text' => 'How big is the matter?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya ia perkara kecil yang remeh, saya boleh lepaskan tanpa sebarang masalah.', 'order' => 410],
            ['start_time' => 1314.805, 'end_time' => 1317.005, 'target_text' => 'If it\'s a minor matter, I can give no problem.', 'source_text' => 'Namun sekiranya ia melibatkan kezaliman yang besar, saya tidak bersedia untuk sekadar melepaskannya.', 'order' => 411],
            ['start_time' => 1317.105, 'end_time' => 1319.205, 'target_text' => 'If it is a major matter, I\'m not prepared.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah sebahagian daripada tuntutan keadilan.', 'order' => 412],
            ['start_time' => 1319.305, 'end_time' => 1320.005, 'target_text' => 'It\'s part of justice.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ia juga sebahagian daripada berbuat ihsan secara bijaksana.', 'order' => 413],
            ['start_time' => 1320.105, 'end_time' => 1322.005, 'target_text' => 'It\'s part of being kind.', 'source_text' => 'Inilah ketetapan Allah SWT.', 'order' => 414],
            ['start_time' => 1322.105, 'end_time' => 1322.805, 'target_text' => 'This is Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah ayat yang sering anda dengarkan.', 'order' => 415],
            ['start_time' => 1322.905, 'end_time' => 1324.105, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the verse you hear.', 'source_text' => 'Dan Allah berfirman: hulurkanlah bantuan,', 'order' => 416],
            ['start_time' => 1324.205, 'end_time' => 1326.605, 'target_text' => 'And Allah says, give', 'source_text' => 'sudah tentu anda juga wajib memberi sumbangan kepada mereka yang memerlukan walau di mana jua mereka berada di seluruh pelosok dunia.', 'order' => 417],
            ['start_time' => 1326.905, 'end_time' => 1330.605, 'target_text' => 'obviously you need to give those in need as well wherever they are across the globe.', 'source_text' => 'Kadang-kadang ia juga berkait rapat dengan tahap keterdesakan dan kecemasan sesuatu situasi.', 'order' => 418],
            ['start_time' => 1330.705, 'end_time' => 1334.205, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes it\'s also got to do with the level of desperation.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mempermudahkan segala urusan kita.', 'order' => 419],
            ['start_time' => 1334.305, 'end_time' => 1335.805, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty make it easy for us.', 'source_text' => 'Di bahagian akhir ayat tersebut, Allah berfirman:', 'order' => 420],
            ['start_time' => 1335.905, 'end_time' => 1339.405, 'target_text' => 'The last part of that verse, Allah says,', 'source_text' => 'Allah melarang daripada melakukan perbuatan keji,', 'order' => 421],
            ['start_time' => 1340.305, 'end_time' => 1343.705, 'target_text' => 'Allah prohibits immorality,', 'source_text' => 'segala kemungkaran, serta kezaliman dan pencerobohan hak.', 'order' => 422],
            ['start_time' => 1344.705, 'end_time' => 1348.206, 'target_text' => 'that which is evil and transgression.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu,', 'order' => 423],
            ['start_time' => 1348.306, 'end_time' => 1350.106, 'target_text' => 'So,', 'source_text' => 'perbuatan keji, apa jua dosa maksiat, dan pencerobohan zalim,', 'order' => 424],
            ['start_time' => 1350.306, 'end_time' => 1354.806, 'target_text' => 'immorality, something which is sinful and transgression.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Yang Maha Kuasa menegaskan bahawa Dia mengharamkan kesemua perkara itu.', 'order' => 425],
            ['start_time' => 1354.906, 'end_time' => 1358.206, 'target_text' => 'Allah Almighty says he prohibits that.', 'source_text' => 'Ayat tersebut mengandungi perintah dan larangan yang kekal relevan sehinggalah hari kiamat; semoga Allah Yang Maha Kuasa memelihara kita daripada segala kejahatan dan kemudaratan.', 'order' => 426],
            ['start_time' => 1358.306, 'end_time' => 1367.106, 'target_text' => 'Those or that verse has an instruction that will actually last up to May Allah Almighty protect us from evil and harm.', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudara-saudariku sekalian, saya ingin mengakhiri ceramah ini dengan berpesan,', 'order' => 427],
            ['start_time' => 1367.206, 'end_time' => 1370.606, 'target_text' => 'My brothers and sisters, I want to end off by saying', 'source_text' => 'bahawa sekalipun pada peringkat global, tatkala negara-negara berdepan konflik, kita sebagai umat Islam diajar untuk mendamaikan sengketa dan berusaha', 'order' => 428],
            ['start_time' => 1370.706, 'end_time' => 1377.506, 'target_text' => 'that even on a global level, when countries have a problem, we as Muslims are taught to resolve the matter and to try and', 'source_text' => 'membincangkan jalan penyelesaian secara diplomasi.', 'order' => 429],
            ['start_time' => 1377.606, 'end_time' => 1379.406, 'target_text' => 'discuss the solutions.', 'source_text' => 'Dan adapun tindakan mengheret negara ke kancah peperangan, ia hanyalah pilihan yang paling terakhir sekali.', 'order' => 430],
            ['start_time' => 1379.506, 'end_time' => 1385.706, 'target_text' => 'And as for becoming countries that are at war, it\'s the last last resort.', 'source_text' => 'Peperangan mesti dielakkan sedaya upaya.', 'order' => 431],
            ['start_time' => 1385.806, 'end_time' => 1388.206, 'target_text' => 'It should be avoided.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: Janganlah kamu saling bertelingkah dan berpecah-belah, kerana nescaya kamu akan gagal,', 'order' => 432],
            ['start_time' => 1396.406, 'end_time' => 1400.406, 'target_text' => 'Allah says don\'t dispute amongst one another because you will be unsuccessful.', 'source_text' => 'dan kamu akan kehilangan kekuatan serta wibawa kamu.', 'order' => 433],
            ['start_time' => 1400.506, 'end_time' => 1402.206, 'target_text' => 'You will lose your power.', 'source_text' => 'Sememangnya ia adalah benar.', 'order' => 434],
            ['start_time' => 1402.306, 'end_time' => 1403.606, 'target_text' => 'It\'s true.', 'source_text' => 'Anda pasti akan kehilangan wibawa dan kekuatan.', 'order' => 435],
            ['start_time' => 1403.706, 'end_time' => 1405.106, 'target_text' => 'You lose your power.', 'source_text' => 'Dan apakah akibatnya?', 'order' => 436],
            ['start_time' => 1405.206, 'end_time' => 1405.706, 'target_text' => 'And what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Allah menegaskan bahawa kamu akhirnya akan ditimpa kegagalan.', 'order' => 437],
            ['start_time' => 1405.806, 'end_time' => 1408.006, 'target_text' => 'Allah says then you become unsuccessful.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kamu... Inilah matlamat utama seluruh perancangan tipu daya syaitan.', 'order' => 438],
            ['start_time' => 1408.106, 'end_time' => 1412.206, 'target_text' => 'And you This is the whole plot of Shaitan.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh sebab itulah, amat penting untuk kita mendamaikan segala pertikaian.', 'order' => 439],
            ['start_time' => 1412.306, 'end_time' => 1414.906, 'target_text' => 'So, this is why it\'s very important to resolve matters.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah membantu kita mendamaikan kemelut dalam keluarga, kemelut dalam masyarakat, permasalahan di dalam negara, konflik di luar negara, dan di mana jua', 'order' => 440],
            ['start_time' => 1415.006, 'end_time' => 1421.906, 'target_text' => 'May Allah help us resolve family matters, community matters, matters within the country, matters abroad, matters wherever', 'source_text' => 'ia berlaku.', 'order' => 441],
            ['start_time' => 1422.006, 'end_time' => 1422.806, 'target_text' => 'they may be.', 'source_text' => 'Berusahalah bersungguh-sungguh, sekurang-kurangnya panjatkanlah doa.', 'order' => 442],
            ['start_time' => 1422.906, 'end_time' => 1424.906, 'target_text' => 'Make an effort, make dua at least.', 'source_text' => 'Mohonlah pertolongan daripada Allah.', 'order' => 443],
            ['start_time' => 1425.006, 'end_time' => 1425.706, 'target_text' => 'Ask Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dengan cara inilah kita mampu menjadi umat yang teguh dan kuat.', 'order' => 444],
            ['start_time' => 1425.806, 'end_time' => 1428.206, 'target_text' => 'In this way, we can be strong.', 'source_text' => 'Fokuslah kepada titik persamaan yang menyatukan anda semua, bukannya asyik menumpukan kepada perbezaan yang memecah-belahkan kamu.', 'order' => 445],
            ['start_time' => 1428.306, 'end_time' => 1434.106, 'target_text' => 'Look at the points that bring you together rather than concentrating on the points that divide you.', 'source_text' => 'Kerap kali anda akan menemui 1,000 titik persamaan yang dikongsi bersama,', 'order' => 446],
            ['start_time' => 1434.206, 'end_time' => 1438.106, 'target_text' => 'A lot of the times you will find 1,000 common points.', 'source_text' => 'namun hanya kerana lima perkara kecil yang anda tidak sependapat dengannya,', 'order' => 447],
            ['start_time' => 1438.206, 'end_time' => 1441.106, 'target_text' => 'And then you will find five things we strongly differ on.', 'source_text' => 'lantaran lima perkara itulah, habis segalanya musnah.', 'order' => 448],
            ['start_time' => 1441.206, 'end_time' => 1443.006, 'target_text' => 'And because of those five, that\'s it.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sanggup berperang sesama sendiri dan saling membunuh antara satu sama lain secara nyata.', 'order' => 449],
            ['start_time' => 1443.106, 'end_time' => 1446.806, 'target_text' => 'We are at war with each other, killing each other literally.', 'source_text' => 'Dan itu sama sekali bukanlah apa yang diredai oleh Allah.', 'order' => 450],
            ['start_time' => 1446.906, 'end_time' => 1448.606, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s not what Allah wants.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa memberkati setiap seorang daripada kita, membantu kita mendamaikan persengketaan dan bertutur dengan penuh rasa hormat antara satu sama lain, serta saling menghargai', 'order' => 451],
            ['start_time' => 1448.706, 'end_time' => 1454.606, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty bless every one of us, help us resolve the dispute and to speak respectfully to one another, to consider', 'source_text' => 'insan yang lain.', 'order' => 452],
            ['start_time' => 1454.706, 'end_time' => 1455.306, 'target_text' => 'the other person.', 'source_text' => 'Kehidupan di dunia ini sangat singkat.', 'order' => 453],
            ['start_time' => 1455.406, 'end_time' => 1456.506, 'target_text' => 'Life is very short.', 'source_text' => 'Hidup kita ini terlalu singkat.', 'order' => 454],
            ['start_time' => 1456.606, 'end_time' => 1458.206, 'target_text' => 'Life is very short.', 'source_text' => 'Sebelum anda menyedarinya, kita semua akan terbujur kaku di bawah tanah (liang lahad).', 'order' => 455],
            ['start_time' => 1458.306, 'end_time' => 1461.506, 'target_text' => 'Before you know it, all of us will be under the ground.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua pasti akan kembali menemui Allah.', 'order' => 456],
            ['start_time' => 1461.606, 'end_time' => 1463.606, 'target_text' => 'All of us will be back to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Sekurang-kurangnya marilah kita kembali menghadap Ilahi dengan hati yang sejahtera di mana kita telah berusaha sedaya upaya di atas muka bumi, dan kita telah memperbaiki keperibadian diri kita.', 'order' => 457],
            ['start_time' => 1463.706, 'end_time' => 1468.407, 'target_text' => 'At least we go back with a good heart where we tried our best on earth, we developed ourselves.', 'source_text' => 'Bercakaplah dengan orang ramai dengan penuh adab dan penghormatan.', 'order' => 458],
            ['start_time' => 1468.507, 'end_time' => 1469.907, 'target_text' => 'Speak to people respectfully.', 'source_text' => 'Lidah ini adalah organ yang boleh meruntuhkan hubungan silaturahim tanpa sebarang sebab yang kukuh.', 'order' => 459],
            ['start_time' => 1470.007, 'end_time' => 1475.407, 'target_text' => 'This tongue is something that can break a relation for no reason.', 'source_text' => 'Hanya kerana kata-kata kesat anda yang menghina seseorang, mereka menangis teresak-esak di belakang anda.', 'order' => 460],
            ['start_time' => 1475.507, 'end_time' => 1478.808, 'target_text' => 'Just because of how you abuse someone, they cry behind you.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka merintih mendoakan keburukan ke atas diri anda di keheningan malam.', 'order' => 461],
            ['start_time' => 1478.908, 'end_time' => 1480.107, 'target_text' => 'They curse you at night.', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah ia berlaku?', 'order' => 462],
            ['start_time' => 1480.207, 'end_time' => 1480.607, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Semata-mata kerana celakanya mulut anda yang celupar.', 'order' => 463],
            ['start_time' => 1480.707, 'end_time' => 1482.907, 'target_text' => 'Just because you have a rough mouth.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita semua tidak terlepas daripada kelemahan ini pada suatu ketika atau terhadap orang-orang tertentu.', 'order' => 464],
            ['start_time' => 1483.007, 'end_time' => 1486.007, 'target_text' => 'And we all have the problem at some point or with some people.', 'source_text' => 'Belajarlah menghormati sesama manusia.', 'order' => 465],
            ['start_time' => 1486.107, 'end_time' => 1487.907, 'target_text' => 'Learn to respect people.', 'source_text' => 'Kemuliaan dan kehormatan itu akan dikurniakan oleh Allah kepada anda semata-mata kerana anda berjaya mengawal lidah anda.', 'order' => 466],
            ['start_time' => 1488.007, 'end_time' => 1493.507, 'target_text' => 'That respect Allah will grant you simply because you controlled your tongue.', 'source_text' => 'Dan atas sebab itulah hadis tatkala Nabi SAW berpesan kepada Mu\'adh bin Jabal: \'Wahai Mu\'adh, kawallah lidahmu ini.\'', 'order' => 467],
            ['start_time' => 1493.607, 'end_time' => 1500.207, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s why the hadith of where the Prophet told him, Oh control your tongue.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu baginda memegang lidah baginda, seketul daging ini.', 'order' => 468],
            ['start_time' => 1500.307, 'end_time' => 1504.007, 'target_text' => 'And he held his this organ, this piece of flesh.', 'source_text' => 'Maka Mu\'adh bertanya:', 'order' => 469],
            ['start_time' => 1504.107, 'end_time' => 1506.907, 'target_text' => 'So says', 'source_text' => '\'Adakah kita benar-benar akan dihisab dan diazab atas apa yang kita tuturkan sedangkan kita belum pun melakukannya dalam bentuk perbuatan?\'', 'order' => 470],
            ['start_time' => 1511.707, 'end_time' => 1515.907, 'target_text' => 'Are we going to be held accountable for what we say when we haven\'t even acted on it?', 'source_text' => '\'Aku cuma bercakap sahaja.\'', 'order' => 471],
            ['start_time' => 1516.007, 'end_time' => 1516.907, 'target_text' => 'I just said something.', 'source_text' => '\'Apakah yang sebenarnya dimaksudkan?\'', 'order' => 472],
            ['start_time' => 1517.007, 'end_time' => 1518.107, 'target_text' => 'I What\'s it all about?', 'source_text' => '\'Bagaimanakah daku boleh dipertanggungjawabkan sebegitu rupa?\'', 'order' => 473],
            ['start_time' => 1518.207, 'end_time' => 1519.407, 'target_text' => 'How can I be held account?', 'source_text' => '\'Adakah kita benar-benar akan dipersoalkan atas setiap tutur kata kita?\'', 'order' => 474],
            ['start_time' => 1519.507, 'end_time' => 1521.207, 'target_text' => 'Are we going to be held accountable?', 'source_text' => 'Nabi SAW bersabda:', 'order' => 475],
            ['start_time' => 1521.307, 'end_time' => 1523.208, 'target_text' => 'He says', 'source_text' => '\'Tidakkah manusia dihumban ke dalam api neraka di atas muka mereka melainkan akibat hasil tuaian lidah mereka sendiri?\'', 'order' => 476],
            ['start_time' => 1529.707, 'end_time' => 1534.507, 'target_text' => 'Is there anything else that is going to drive people to hell besides their tongues?', 'source_text' => 'Lidah itulah yang bakal membawa anda ke syurga atau mengheret anda ke neraka jahanam.', 'order' => 477],
            ['start_time' => 1534.607, 'end_time' => 1537.707, 'target_text' => 'It\'s the tongue that will take you to heaven or hell.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, perkara ini adalah sesuatu yang amat mustahak.', 'order' => 478],
            ['start_time' => 1537.807, 'end_time' => 1539.107, 'target_text' => 'So this is something very important.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah sebuah hadis yang sangat mendalam dan menggetarkan jiwa.', 'order' => 479],
            ['start_time' => 1539.207, 'end_time' => 1540.607, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a very powerful hadith.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan taufik kepada kita semua. Semoga Allah memperbaiki kehidupan kita dan kehidupan seluruh insan yang sedang bergelut dan menderita di serata', 'order' => 480],
            ['start_time' => 1540.707, 'end_time' => 1546.607, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us all May Allah improve our lives and the lives of all those who are struggling and suffering across', 'source_text' => 'pelosok dunia.', 'order' => 481],
            ['start_time' => 1546.707, 'end_time' => 1548.607, 'target_text' => 'the globe.', 'source_text' => 'Aamiin Ya Rabbal \'Alamin.', 'order' => 482],
        ];

